The icons in this directory are rendered from the "cow face" emoji (U+1F42E)
of Noto Emoji by Google: https://github.com/googlefonts/noto-emoji
Source file: 2D/svg/emoji_u1f42e.svg (copied to assets/emoji_u1f42e.svg)

Noto Emoji image resources are licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0:
https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0

The icons were resized to 16, 32, 48 and 128 px; no other changes were made.
This is a generic emoji, not the Remember The Milk logo.
